1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 11]

34
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,840
But when we chose him,

35
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:43,090
you agreed too.

36
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:53,220
Chang'an.

37
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,000
Sir.

38
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:58,340
Go find Lu Li.

39
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,130
I'll take it to them.

40
00:02:14,580 --> 00:02:15,850
My lord truly cares for me.

41
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:17,090
He didn't want me working too hard,

42
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:17,870
so he did it himself.

43
00:02:19,630 --> 00:02:20,430
Idiot.

44
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:24,080
Chang'an.

45
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,200
Yeah?

46
00:02:25,410 --> 00:02:26,400
What are you drinking?

47
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:28,560
A gift from His Majesty.

48
00:02:28,810 --> 00:02:29,630
Jiannan spring wine.

49
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:37,470
Good wine.

50
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,150
When did His Majesty give you that?

51
00:02:41,060 --> 00:02:43,960
You stole that from my room?

52
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:45,420
Give it back.

53
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,370
It was for My Lord's victory feast.

54
00:02:47,830 --> 00:02:49,360
We'll win this campaign anyway.

55
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,600
So let's celebrate it now.

56
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:52,030
Give it to him.

57
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:53,920
One last sip.

58
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,150
Here.

59
00:02:59,150 --> 00:02:59,590
Lu.

60
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:01,590
You've been spoiled.

61
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,710
For your wedding, sir,

62
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:11,080
it has to be something gold.

63
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:15,760
Well,

64
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:17,120
after all that,

65
00:03:17,130 --> 00:03:18,310
you're marrying my sister.

66
00:03:19,810 --> 00:03:22,120
So should I call you

67
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,030
Brother-in-law?

68
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:26,680
Don't call me that.

69
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:28,260
I'll be counting on you, brother-in-law.

70
00:03:28,950 --> 00:03:29,470
Still calling me that?

71
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,110
Brother-in-law.

72
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,190
Brother-in-law.

73
00:03:33,290 --> 00:03:34,120
Get a grip.

74
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:35,440
We're on a mission.

75
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:37,470
Why are you being like this?

76
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:43,080
What are you doing?

77
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:45,310
Another wedding gift for me?

78
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,520
I have better things to do.

79
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,360
This powder glows at night.

80
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,870
I put it in the incense-bead pendants.

81
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:55,030
Whoever finds them first

82
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,430
can crush one to leave a mark.

83
00:03:58,630 --> 00:03:59,650
Let me give you some first.

84
00:03:59,650 --> 00:04:00,360
Stop it.

85
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,310
Here, take this.

86
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:16,200
Why bring the Crown Prince's
Fangfei bracelet?

87
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:17,870
Not that one.

88
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:19,090
I bought this myself.

89
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:25,780
What's special about it?

90
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,680
Poison inside?

91
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:29,750
A hidden weapon?

92
00:04:29,890 --> 00:04:30,750
Some kind of trap?

93
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:31,440
No.

94
00:04:32,070 --> 00:04:33,680
Didn't you say
you liked Fangfei bracelets?

95
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,390
Didn't you say

96
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:35,800
no flashy stuff on missions?

97
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,070
Wear it

98
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,600
or toss it.

99
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:40,220
Why'd you snatch it back,
Brother-in-law?

100
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:40,680
Yun...

101
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:47,270
I have my reasons.

102
00:04:48,630 --> 00:04:49,800
So stop calling me that.

103
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:22,750
Who's that?

104
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,630
Prince of Xin'an.

105
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:26,830
When did His Majesty summon him back?

106
00:05:27,070 --> 00:05:28,270
Why didn't we hear anything?

107
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,480
Quite the show for a prince.

108
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,440
Father tells me nothing these days.

109
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,510
The Fengyi Secret Guard,

110
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:36,120
Pei Zhao's marriage...

111
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,780
Not a word.

112
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,000
He is the only man in Yong

113
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,710
who earned through military merit

114
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,800
a princely title from His Majesty.

115
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,750
If His Majesty is unhappy with you,

116
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:46,770
leaving the capital without permission

117
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,090
may anger him further.

118
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:50,190
He's guarded the southern border
for years.

119
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,480
He has great influence in the army.

120
00:05:51,790 --> 00:05:53,070
His Majesty relies on him too.

121
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,310
We should return to the capital at once.

122
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:10,040
What's there to fear?

123
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,720
Mingyu is in Mingcheng.

124
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,680
I'll show Father and the Noble Consort

125
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:17,480
I can solve the tremor and Mingyu case

126
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:20,300
without Pei Zhao.

127
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:22,920
Your Highness, a letter
from Proprietor Xiao.

128
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,720
Feels like

129
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,430
I've seen him before.

130
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,840
Sharp nose, that hound.

131
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:33,310
This time,

132
00:06:33,810 --> 00:06:36,150
I will tame that hound myself.

133
00:06:59,570 --> 00:07:00,190
Sir?

134
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:01,280
Sir?

135
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:02,750
Are we there yet?

136
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,120
Are you asleep?

137
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,360
I remember

138
00:07:08,910 --> 00:07:10,680
I had a cradle as a kid.

139
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,310
It was pretty beat-up,

140
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,390
but rocking in it

141
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:15,720
put me right to sleep.

142
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:17,920
You were just getting dizzy.

143
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:21,480
So you did that on purpose.

144
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:22,950
Your Highness?

145
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:23,950
What are you doing here?

146
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,830
We shouldn't have grabbed these men.

147
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:27,630
What a hassle.

148
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,120
Master's making Gu.

149
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,720
We can use them as fodder.

150
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,310
Hear that?

151
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,240
They're going to use you as fodder.

152
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:35,830
Use your Incense Escape Technique.

153
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,310
It right here.

154
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:38,390
But my hands are tied.

155
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:03,390
Hyah.

156
00:08:12,490 --> 00:08:13,000
Sir.

157
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,600
The Crown Prince is still dizzy.

158
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,160
Should we take him back?

159
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,040
No.

160
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:19,310
Once we get there,

161
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:20,400
he can still be useful.

162
00:08:21,130 --> 00:08:22,600
If this goes badly

163
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,720
and His Majesty gets angry,

164
00:08:23,950 --> 00:08:25,040
we can let him take the blame.

165
00:08:25,430 --> 00:08:26,870
You can be devious too, sir.

166
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,430
I never said I was a good man.

167
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:31,120
Nonsense.

168
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:32,930
You're a good man.

169
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,000
Careful.

170
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,630
You don't need to do that anymore.

171
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:42,790
Men and women shouldn't be so close.

172
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:44,360
You're getting married soon.

173
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:45,670
Married?

174
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,480
I grew up an orphan.

175
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,900
I mined blood jade for 14 years.

176
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,290
You mined blood jade?

177
00:08:55,170 --> 00:08:55,670
Yes.

178
00:08:57,130 --> 00:08:58,550
Then I joined the Fengyi Bureau

179
00:08:58,750 --> 00:09:00,630
and faced danger every day.

180
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,910
Women never crossed my mind.

181
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,670
When you first joined the Bureau,

182
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:08,030
didn't Lu Li warn you

183
00:09:08,350 --> 00:09:10,750
not to get any ideas?

184
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,720
I'm not thinking about romance.

185
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:16,000
I'm going to be the top female guard.

186
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,630
You should say that

187
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,870
to my sister, Brother-in-law.

188
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:22,030
Stop it.

189
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,270
You'll fall.

190
00:09:23,730 --> 00:09:25,280
Why are you telling me this?

191
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,080
I don't know.

192
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,630
The view is beautiful.

193
00:09:31,550 --> 00:09:32,910
It makes me want a normal life.

194
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:44,620
[Mingyu Headquarters]

195
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:55,600
You look unfamiliar.

196
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:56,790
Enough talking.

197
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,720
Get them inside.

198
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:03,550
Move.

199
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,000
Why are they all men?

200
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:22,510
Women are harder to catch.

201
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:24,510
They're fodder for Master's Gu.

202
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:26,390
Move.

203
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:44,980
Lock them all up.

204
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:51,320
Stop.

205
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,750
You can't enter the inner courtyard.

206
00:10:57,950 --> 00:10:58,960
Caught another couple.

207
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:00,160
Come help.

208
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:02,870
What are you waiting for?

209
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:03,700
Go help them.

210
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,440
You guys, come with me.

211
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:11,720
- I got it.
- Let me.

212
00:11:27,210 --> 00:11:29,120
Xu and I will scout ahead

213
00:11:29,940 --> 00:11:30,960
and see what's happening.

214
00:11:31,190 --> 00:11:32,180
Wait here for word.

215
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:32,750
Yes.

216
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,360
Let me out first.

217
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:35,870
Your Highness,

218
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:36,960
the cage is safer.

219
00:11:37,430 --> 00:11:37,970
Pei Zhao.

220
00:11:37,970 --> 00:11:38,640
How dare you?

221
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,600
You locked His Highness in a cage?

222
00:11:40,770 --> 00:11:41,810
Because you couldn't handle it,

223
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:43,000
and made His Highness look foolish.

224
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,550
Ruoming, you've got some nerve.

225
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:46,120
And you still blame our commander.

226
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:46,790
Enough.

227
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:49,390
We'll follow Lord Pei's plan.

228
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:52,100
Your Highness.

229
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:54,030
Keep this incense pouch with you.

230
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:56,720
Thank you.

231
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,790
You keep giving in to them.

232
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,370
He keeps pushing it.

233
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,270
Then fight your own way out.

234
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:12,000
Quit whining.

235
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,910
Enough.

236
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:13,810
What's going on?

237
00:12:13,810 --> 00:12:15,120
Don't push your luck.

238
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,080
Keep causing trouble

239
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:17,080
and I'll break your bones.

240
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:22,960
Get away.

241
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:23,750
Keep your distance.

242
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:37,390
This is

243
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,270
a blood sacrifice.

244
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,840
Is that a woman?

245
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,840
Her muscles are bigger than mine.

246
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,320
Her feet are huge too.

247
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:54,390
Stop looking.

248
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:55,700
Just chop off her hand.

249
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,550
Makes draining the blood easier.

250
00:13:03,830 --> 00:13:04,440
Your Highness.

251
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:05,390
Back off.

252
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,540
Run.

253
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:14,810
Run.

254
00:13:26,630 --> 00:13:27,120
Wei Lin.

255
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,750
Get the Crown Prince somewhere safe.

256
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:29,840
How dare you?

257
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,360
You dare tell me to hide?

258
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,240
Stay here, Your Highness.

259
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:39,060
I'll help them.

260
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,160
No.

261
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,030
You're a woman.

262
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,000
You should stay here.

263
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:42,810
I'm the Crown Prince.

264
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:43,480
I can't back down.

265
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:43,840
Your Highness.

266
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:44,750
I'm a Fengyi Guard.

267
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,480
Protecting you is my duty.

268
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:55,720
Chang'an.

269
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:56,550
Incense Escape Technique.

270
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:05,580
Sir.

271
00:14:06,030 --> 00:14:06,720
Your face.

272
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,440
So is yours.

273
00:14:10,550 --> 00:14:11,790
When did you learn that?

274
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:13,120
Secret.

275
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:14,840
Outsiders can't know.

276
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:17,140
Chang'an, are you okay?

277
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,040
I'm fine.

278
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:19,800
Where's Ruoming?

279
00:14:21,510 --> 00:14:22,110
Over there.

280
00:14:22,350 --> 00:14:23,120
He got knocked out too.

281
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:25,910
Sir.

282
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,000
The fight's over.

283
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:28,720
And you just arrived?

284
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:29,870
Did you do that on purpose?

285
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,750
Your Highness, are your eyes all right?

286
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,180
That powder's strong.

287
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,120
I'll get some water.

288
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:53,670
Your Highness.

289
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:56,750
Wipe your eyes with this.

290
00:14:56,850 --> 00:14:57,840
It'll ease the pain.

291
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,530
No need.

292
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,870
You're the Crown Prince.

293
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,720
People expect a lot from you.

294
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:09,440
But you're human, not a god.

295
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:11,670
In a situation like this,

296
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,740
it's natural to hesitate.

297
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,440
But...

298
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:17,910
none of you backed down.

299
00:15:19,330 --> 00:15:20,340
The Fengyi Guards

300
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,630
were no less afraid

301
00:15:23,870 --> 00:15:25,440
the first time they drew a blade.

302
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,150
Neither was I.

303
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,320
You really think so?

304
00:15:29,910 --> 00:15:31,270
You don't think I'm weak?

305
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,480
You said

306
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,550
I'm a woman

307
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,240
and should be protected.

308
00:15:36,630 --> 00:15:37,480
That tells me

309
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,960
you're not weak at all.

310
00:15:39,450 --> 00:15:40,760
You value life.

311
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:41,960
You're kind by nature.

312
00:15:43,550 --> 00:15:45,200
A kind ruler is a blessing
to the people.

313
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,320
Guard Xu,

314
00:15:49,630 --> 00:15:50,960
you're good with incense

315
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:53,200
and even better at comforting people.

316
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,240
I was just scared.

317
00:15:58,390 --> 00:15:59,270
It wasn't kindness.

318
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:00,800
Valuing life

319
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,210
is kindness.

320
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,080
I'm not a god.

321
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:15,670
I'm human.

322
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,240
Sadly, Mother Consort never saw it so.

323
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,960
All made of blood jade.

324
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,360
That's why
they abducted blood-jade craftsmen.

325
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,320
This is what they wanted them for.

326
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,600
This is just ordinary white jade.

327
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:51,600
Mingyu is forging

328
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:54,380
blood-jade ritual vessels for profit.

329
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,800
Sir.

330
00:16:57,130 --> 00:16:57,730
Sir.

331
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,390
Sir.

332
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,150
In the secret chamber,

333
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:05,030
we found 29 girls' bodies.

334
00:17:05,310 --> 00:17:06,510
They were drained of blood.

335
00:17:06,930 --> 00:17:07,630
Monsters.

336
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,110
The worst part is,

337
00:17:10,270 --> 00:17:11,420
they only died recently.

338
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,030
If we'd come sooner,

339
00:17:13,730 --> 00:17:14,790
we might've saved them.

340
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:16,550
Sir.

341
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,350
We caught one alive.

342
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:42,130
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

343
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:46,940
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

344
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:50,000
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

345
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:54,940
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

346
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:59,770
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

347
00:18:00,990 --> 00:18:06,000
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

348
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:14,350
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

349
00:18:14,620 --> 00:18:23,240
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

350
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:31,910
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

351
00:18:32,290 --> 00:18:41,160
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

352
00:18:41,590 --> 00:18:50,080
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
